      "text": "Pavlovian regulation uses the same strict factor-of-2 rule as the memory registration: the stimulated mean must be at least twice the comparison mean and strictly greater, or at most half and strictly smaller. A flat trajectory is not regulation. Habituation and sensitization already require a strict rise or fall. Fixed before any gene-circuit or pathway trajectory for this claim was computed."
