  "method": "analysis.py integrates the pre-registered gene-circuit equation on 40 random networks (numpy Generator seed 20261101) and four fixed motifs, then checks that each weight matrix is unchanged. Habituation and sensitization use the six-epoch 1.5 rule at clamp scale 100. Pavlovian conditioning uses the strict factor-of-2 rule on 50-time-unit epochs at scale 100. The same three tests are applied to Table S1 pathway SBML with libroadrunner rates and scipy BDF, models outside 3\u201312 floating species excluded, one model per subprocess. The pathway loop stops once every pathway phenotype has been seen. decide() returns supports only when both panels show all three phenotypes.",
